title: Remove deprecated schedule::v2 traits
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Part of #11561

    Removes the deprecated `frame_support::traits::schedule::v2` traits and the corresponding compatibility impls in `pallet-scheduler`.

    The deprecation note says `v2` would be removed after September 2024. In-repo usage is already limited to the old scheduler compatibility impls, so this PR removes the deprecated API surface and keeps the `v3` scheduler traits as the supported path.

    ## Integration

    Downstream users should migrate from `frame_support::traits::schedule::v2::{Anon, Named}` to `frame_support::traits::schedule::v3::{Anon, Named}`.
crates:
- name: pallet-scheduler
  bump: major
- name: frame-support
  bump: major
